\begin_layout Standard
\SpecialChar ldots
 and that’s pretty much that!
 This implements POWER evaluation.
 The ‘while’ loop just goes round and round until i runs down.
 More explanation is clearly needed,
 but not that much:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Code is in the form of a sequence of ‘Atoms’,
 lined up in XEC.R.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
We identify the current Atom by the index in XEC.i.
 We sequentially pull out each atom A using A = XEC.R[XEC.i];
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
To implement POWER,
